## Data Collection Flow

```
Linux-Endpoint              Windows-Endpoint
├─ /var/log/auth.log ──┐    ├─ Security 4625 (RDP fail) ──┐
├─ /var/log/ufw.log ───┤    ├─ PowerShell 4104 ──────────┤
├─ FIM /etc/passwd ────┼───►│  SOC-SIEM                    ├──► macOS Browser
├─ FIM /opt/important ─┤    │  Wazuh Manager                │    (analyst review)
└─ SSH failures ───────┘    │  Wazuh Indexer                │
                            │  Wazuh Dashboard (HTTPS 443)  │
                            └───────────────────────────────┘
                                     ▲
                                     │
                              Wazuh Agent (Port 1514)
```

## Alert Generation Flow

```
ATTACK                DETECTION                    RESPONSE

Attacker-Box ─▶ SSH brute force ─▶ Wazuh alert ─▶ IR-001 (Linux)
Attacker-Box ─▶ RDP brute force ─▶ Wazuh alert ─▶ IR-007 (Windows)
Attacker-Box ─▶ Port scan ──────▶ Wazuh alert ─▶ IR-002 (Either)
Linux-Endpt  ─▶ New user ────────▶ FIM alert ───▶ IR-004 (Linux)
Linux-Endpt  ─▶ File modified ───▶ FIM alert ───▶ IR-005 (Linux)
Windows-Endpt─▶ Encoded PS ──────▶ 4104 alert ──▶ IR-008 (Windows)
Windows-Endpt─▶ EICAR file ───────▶ Defender ───▶ IR-009 (Windows)
Windows-Endpt─▶ Defender detect ─▶ 1116 alert ──▶ IR-009 (Windows)
```

