## Recommended Running Combinations

| Goal | Run These VMs | Total RAM |
|---|---|---:|
| Build SIEM | SOC-SIEM only | 4 GB |
| Linux attack lab | SOC-SIEM + Linux + Attacker | 6-7 GB |
| Windows attack lab | SOC-SIEM + Windows + Attacker | 7-8 GB |
| Cross-platform review | SOC-SIEM + Linux + Windows | 7-8 GB (very tight) |

**Rule:** Run only ONE endpoint platform alongside the SIEM and attacker at a time.
